## Proposed Schema — PO Review Task

Here's exactly what the Action Center task will look like:

### 📋 Fields the reviewer sees (read-only)

| Field | Type | What it shows |
|---|---|---|
| **PO Number** | string | The PO identifier (e.g. `PO-2024-0042`) |
| **Vendor Name** | string | Who the PO is from (e.g. `Acme Corp`) |
| **Total Amount** | number | The dollar value (e.g. `14750.00`) |

### ✏️ Fields the reviewer fills in

| Field | Type | Required? | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Notes** | string | No | Optional comment — useful for rejection reasons |

### 🟢 Action buttons

| Button | Behaviour |
|---|---|
| **Approve** ✅ (primary) | Flow continues → logs the approval |
| **Reject** ❌ | Flow ends immediately |

### 🔄 Flow structure

```
[Manual Trigger]
     ↓
[Script: Load mock PO data]   ← seeds PO Number, Vendor Name, Amount
     ↓
[HITL: PO Review]             ← you Approve or Reject, optionally add Notes
     ↓ (completed)
[Script: Log approval]        ← only runs on Approve; logs the result
```

The Reject outcome is set to `action: "End"` so the flow stops cleanly — no extra node needed.

