### Flow structure

```
[Manual Trigger]
       │ output
       ▼
[Load mock PO data]            ← script: seeds PO-2024-0042 / Acme Corp / $14,750.00
       │ output
       ▼
[PO Review]  ◀── Action Center task lands here
       │ completed
       ▼
