```

The **Reject** outcome has `"action": "End"` — clicking it closes the flow immediately, no extra node needed.

### Schema the reviewer sees

| Field | Direction | What it shows |
|---|---|---|
| PO Number | read-only | `PO-2024-0042` (from mock script) |
| Vendor Name | read-only | `Acme Corp` |
| Total Amount | read-only | `14750` |
| Notes | editable | Optional free-text (e.g. rejection reason) |

**Buttons:** **Approve** (primary, green) · **Reject**

### Runtime variables available downstream

| Variable | What it contains |
|---|---|
| `$vars.poReview1.output.notes` | Whatever you typed in the Notes field |
| `$vars.poReview1.status` | `"Approve"` or `"Reject"` |

